<title>ITALY: DeBenedetti Espresso 1H96 in pretax profit.</title>
<headline>DeBenedetti Espresso 1H96 in pretax profit.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ending June 30, 1996</p>
<p>(In billion lire unless stated)</p>
<p>    Cons pre-tax profit		   14.7  vs   (3.2)</p>
<p>    Turnover				 621.8  vs  527.5</p>
<p>    Cons operating result		 28.1  vs   14.2</p>
<p>    Cons gross operating margin	 53.4  vs   35.8</p>
<p>    Net debt				  16.3  vs   23.5</p>
<p>    Investment			     209    vs    n/a</p>
<p>    Parent pre-tax profit		 15.8  vs    0.6</p>
<p>Note - Company name is Editoriale l'Espresso and it is controlled by the De Benedetti family. Espresso said in a statement the positive trend in turnover continued into the second half of 1996. -- Milan newsroom +392 66129450</p>
</text>
